  "Description": "Help protect your furbaby from fleas, ticks, and mosquitoes with Ortho Pawz All Natural Dog & Cat Flea & Tick Spray. This spray offers a plant-based alternative to harsh chemical treatments. It uses a citrus oil formula that's safe for daily use on dogs and cats, including puppies and kittens, so it's perfect for your whole fur fam. The spray works on contact to help repel and control common parasites like fleas, ticks, mosquitoes, lice, and mites. Since the formula is gentle enough to use on your furry friend's bedding and grooming tools, it's a versatile addition to your pest control routine. Made in the USA, this spray provides an easy way to help keep your best friend comfortable without relying on potentially harsh ingredients.",
